##### Python

::: {#65a16afd .cell execution_count=53}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def spruce(n, ps):
    """ps is p_2, p_3, ..., p_n."""
    children = [0] * (n + 1)
    leaf_kids = [0] * (n + 1)
    p = [0] * (n + 1)
    for i, pi in enumerate(ps, start=2):
        p[i] = pi
        children[pi] += 1
    for i in range(2, n + 1):
        if children[i] == 0:
            leaf_kids[p[i]] += 1
    ok = all(leaf_kids[v] >= 3 for v in range(1, n + 1) if children[v])
    return "Yes" if ok else "No"
```
