``` {.python .cell-code}
def subtree_sizes_climb(parent, s):
    n = len(parent)
    new_par = parent[:]
    for x in range(1, n):
        v = parent[x]
        while v != -1 and s[v] != s[x]:
            v = parent[v]
        if v != -1:
            new_par[x] = v
    sz = [0] * n
    for x in range(n):
        v = x
        while v != -1:
            sz[v] += 1
            v = new_par[v]
    return sz
```
