::: {.callout-note collapse="true" title="[E] Time to inform every employee"}
[LC 1376 · Time Needed to Inform All Employees](https://leetcode.com/problems/time-needed-to-inform-all-employees/){difficulty="Medium"}. The minute an employee hears the news is the sum of `informTime` from the head down to that employee's manager. Head $2$, managers `[2,2,-1,2,2,2]` and times `[0,0,1,0,0,0]` finish in $1$ minute.

::: {#dc61c0b4 .cell execution_count=92}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def inform_all(manager, inform_time, head):
    n = len(manager)
    heard = [-1] * n
    heard[head] = 0
    best = 0
    for i in range(n):
        chain = []
        x = i
        while heard[x] < 0:
            chain.append(x)
            x = manager[x]
        for y in reversed(chain):
            heard[y] = heard[manager[y]] + inform_time[manager[y]]
        best = max(best, heard[i])
    return best

assert inform_all([2, 2, -1, 2, 2, 2], [0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0], 2) == 1
```
